## 11 Business Modules Breakdown

### 1. Crime Records Module (`/crimes`, `/crimes/[id]`)
- **Backend**:
  - Soft-delete support (`is_deleted`, `deleted_at`), restore endpoint (`POST /crimes/{id}/restore`).
  - Crime assignment (`POST /crimes/{id}/assign`), status/priority/severity patch endpoints.
  - Complete timeline generation (`CrimeTimeline` audit trail).
  - Search by crime number/title/description, filter by `crime_type`, `status`, `priority`, `severity`, date range.
- **Frontend**:
  - Full CRUD UI with loading skeletons, confirmation modals, drawer forms.
  - Detailed view with Crime Timeline, assigned officer panel, linked FIR, evidence gallery, linked suspects, victims, witnesses, and investigation status.

### 2. FIR Registry (`/firs`, `/firs/[id]`)
- **Backend**:
  - FIR CRUD, crime linking, unique `FIR-YYYY-XXXX` auto-generation.
  - PDF generation service (`reportlab` integration) for instant FIR PDF download (`GET /firs/{id}/pdf`).
  - Search, status workflow (`Registered` -> `Under Review` -> `Verified` -> `Closed`).
- **Frontend**:
  - FIR table, filter by IPC section/status, create/edit modal.
  - "Print FIR" / "Download PDF" view formatted as official police report document.

### 3. Criminal Profiles (`/criminals`, `/criminals/[id]`)
- **Backend**:
  - Criminal profile CRUD (Name, alias, photo URL, DOB, gender, address, identification marks, risk/wanted status).
  - Crime association (`CrimeCriminal` pivot table: Suspect, Accomplice, Convicted).
  - Risk level scoring (Low, Medium, High, Critical) and associates listing.
- **Frontend**:
  - Mugshot gallery & grid/list views, risk status indicators, crime history timeline.

### 4. Victims Module (`/victims`)
- **Backend**:
  - Victim CRUD linked to crimes, emergency contact details, statement recording, medical report attachment.
- **Frontend**:
  - Linked victims panel within Crime Details + standalone Victim Directory with search & emergency contact modal.

### 5. Witnesses Module (`/witnesses`)
- **Backend**:
  - Witness CRUD linked to crimes, protected witness flag (`is_protected`), statement recording, contact shielding for RBAC.
- **Frontend**:
  - Protected witness UI badge, statement recorder, linking modal.

### 6. Evidence Locker (`/evidence`, `/evidence/[id]`)
- **Backend**:
  - Multi-media upload (Images, PDF, Video, Audio) via Cloudinary/Local storage fallback.
  - Evidence metadata, unique Barcode/Evidence ID (`EVD-YYYY-XXXX`), storage locker/shelf location, status (`In Locker`, `In Lab`, `Court Presentation`, `Disposed`).
  - Chain of custody movement logs (`EvidenceChainOfCustody` table).
- **Frontend**:
  - Interactive Evidence Locker board with file previews (lightbox for images, embedded PDF viewer, HTML5 video player).
  - Barcode badge, chain of custody movement modal.

### 7. Investigation Module (`/investigations`, `/investigations/[id]`)
- **Backend**:
  - Case assignment, Lead Officer + Supporting Officers mapping.
  - Case Diary entry log (`CaseDiary`), investigation progress percentage, target deadlines, status transitions (`In Progress`, `Pending Chargesheet`, `Closed`, `Cold Case`).
- **Frontend**:
  - Investigation Kanban / Case Diary timeline, officer assignment drawer, deadline tracker.

### 8. Officer Management (`/officers`, `/officers/[id]`)
- **Backend**:
  - Officer profiles (User entity extended with rank, station, badge number, active cases count, performance score).
  - Officer workload query, availability status, active case load assignment check.
- **Frontend**:
  - Police Roster view, workload metrics, assigned crimes drawer, performance indicator.

### 9. GIS Crime Map (`/map`)
- **Backend**:
  - Spatial spatial query endpoints `GET /api/v1/map/crimes` returning GeoJSON markers with location, category, severity, status.
- **Frontend**:
  - Leaflet / Mapbox interactive dark-tile map with crime clusters, category filters, heatmap overlay toggle, popup card with direct navigation link to Crime Details.

### 10. Real Analytics (`/analytics`)
- **Backend**:
  - Analytics aggregations: Crime trends over time (monthly/weekly), Crime type distribution, Severity breakdown, Resolution rate, Station performance metrics, Officer resolution times.
- **Frontend**:
  - Comprehensive Analytics Dashboard powered by Recharts (Bar, Line, Pie, Radar charts) with date range filter and export capability.

### 11. Enterprise Audit Logs (`/logs`)
- **Backend**:
  - AuditLog query endpoint with filter by action type, entity, user, date range, IP address, and CSV export.
- **Frontend**:
  - Filterable system activity stream with IP address, user badges, action category tags, and JSON payload inspector modal.

