## Database Schema Enhancements

To support Chain of Custody and Supporting Officers cleanly:
1. `EvidenceChainOfCustody`: `id`, `evidence_id`, `moved_from`, `moved_to`, `reason`, `moved_by_id`, `timestamp`.
2. `InvestigationOfficer`: `id`, `investigation_id`, `officer_id`, `role` (Lead / Supporting).

Alembic migration script `add_phase2_tables.py` will be generated and executed to update SQLite/PostgreSQL cleanly without dropping existing data.

